ional community. The mechanisms are the policy measures and the cooperative frameworks, respectively. The objective is the global diffusion of technologies. Does this model explain the \"how\" of the diffusion? Yes, by bridging the gap between domestic demand and international supply. I must be careful not to assume the report says this exactly, but I am looking for the logical structure that best explains the interplay described in the context of addressing development objectives and capacity gaps. The strongest direction involves a synergy where policy and cooperation are not redundant but are instead complementary components of a single functional mechanism.\n**Final Answer**"
