 - Mass Balance • ISCC CORSIA – Segregated • ISCC EU – Identity preserved [Palm oil, Cattle products, Soy, Timber products, Coffee, Cocoa] • ISCC EU - Mass Balance [Palm oil, Cattle products, Soy, Timber products, Coffee, Cocoa]",
